       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. QUALIFIED-TEST.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 GROUP-A.
          05 ITEM PIC 999 VALUE 12.
       01 GROUP-B.
          05 ITEM PIC 999 VALUE 34.
       01 RESULT-A PIC 999.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PROCEDURE.
           MOVE ITEM OF GROUP-B TO RESULT-A.
           DISPLAY "QUALIFIED=" RESULT-A.
           ADD ITEM IN GROUP-A TO RESULT-A.
           DISPLAY "SUM=" RESULT-A.
           STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM QUALIFIED-TEST.
